OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 10, critically injured in
OL,4,Athree-car crash in Scottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old boy has been critically
OL,7,Finjured in a crash in the Scottish
OL,8,FBorders.
OL,10,FFour other people were also taken to
OL,11,Fhospital after the collision on the
OL,12,FA701 south of Blyth Bridge at about
OL,13,F12:15 on Friday.
OL,15,FThree vehicles were involved - a white
OL,16,FSeat Leon, a black Audi Q5 and a red
OL,17,FJaguar F Pace.
OL,19,FPolice closed the road for
OL,20,Finvestigation until 19:10 on Friday and
OL,21,Furged anyone with information to
OL,22,Fcontact them.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
